+This feature is meant to fix variations in files, not to implement tiering or move recordings between paths. When storage tiers are configured, Frigate checks all configured recording directories while syncing. If you delete all of your media, don't use `sync_recordings`, just stop Frigate, delete the `frigate.db` database, and restart.
 
